This repository contains build scripts, patches and documentation for
redistributing GNU Emacs 31.1 on Windows on ARM64.

GNU Emacs itself is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or
later. Because this repository distributes binaries of Emacs (via GitHub
Releases) together with the exact recipe used to produce them, the whole
repository is distributed under the same licence.

The full text of the GNU General Public License version 3 is the same text that
ships with Emacs itself; see the COPYING file in any Emacs distribution, or
<https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt>.
